    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A Crumbling Empire: Part 1</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After Adora finds a mysterious sword in the Whispering Woods, she and Catra venture out to find some answers. What they find instead is that not only is Adora a princess, she's the most powerful one of all: She-Ra, Princess of Power. The Brightmoon Rebellion's days are numbered with this new power being used for the Horde.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
